StarDist on PyTorch -- third-party notices
==========================================

What this directory is
----------------------
The 2D StarDist network (`2D_versatile_fluo`) written as a PyTorch forward
pass. The StarDist model still runs as `stardist.models.StarDist2D`; only its
Keras network object is replaced. Normalisation, padding, the sparse
non-maximum suppression, the polygon reconstruction and the label image stay
the stardist package's own code.

